      {
        "id": 85055,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-22T02:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, you can do the 3 damage without destroying anything as long as there are no hero cards in play. The Sentinels rules say that if you cannot do the full effect of a card just do as much as you can.</p><p>If the wording had been \"Destroy a hero ongoing or equipment. If you do then Mr. Fixer deals 1 target 3 damage.\" then you'd have to destroy to get the damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:08:36.255Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
