        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yes, you can do the 3 damage without destroying anything as long as there are no hero cards in play. The Sentinels rules say that if you cannot do the full effect of a card just do as much as you can.</p><p>If the wording had been &quot;Destroy a hero ongoing or equipment. If you do then Mr. Fixer deals 1 target 3 damage.&quot; then you&#39;d have to destroy to get the damage.</p>",
