      {
        "id": 85056,
        "name": "JimmytheRat",
        "username": "JimmytheRat",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-22T05:48:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Note that if there is an equipment in play but no ongoings, you can't say \"I'm gonna destroy an ongoing, oops there aren't any!\" in order to get the damage for free (or vice versa).&nbsp; If there is a valid option in play, you have to choose it.</p>",
