        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-22T07:22:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What Jimmy said. The other statements are not wrong, but that one seems to answer your question more precisely. When they say \"destroy a hero ongoing or equipment card\", it's not really a statement of \"destroy a hero ongoing card or destroy an equipment card\" (which I believe would let you avoid destroying equipment if you had no ongoings, and vice versa); it's more \"destroy a card (which may either be a hero ongoing card or an equipment card)\".</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:08:36.411Z",
